    "description": "The Loyalty History Retrieval API enables businesses to access detailed loyalty program histories associated with their customers. This endpoint allows authorized users to retrieve a comprehensive list of loyalty transactions, points, and rewards history to better understand customer engagement and reward interactions. Typical consumers of this API include marketing teams and customer relationship management (CRM) systems that need to analyze customer loyalty behavior for targeted campaigns. By leveraging this data, businesses can enhance customer experiences and overall loyalty strategies.",
